Subject: [PATCH] lvgl: support chinese fonts

---
 src/font/lv_font.h                       |      4 +
 src/font/lv_font.mk                      |      1 +
 src/font/lv_font_siyuanheiti_normal_24.c | 228231 ++++++++++++++++++++
